# The synthetic planet of the regression suite (401 points, tests/regression/synthetic_planet.dat), its own cell
# (log10 s = 0.2, log10 q = -3), seeds k % 24 == 0 (10 of 240). The source crosses a caustic: about 7 % of the points
# need VBMicrolensing's finite-source contour integration, which is most of the time on every backend.
photometry tests/regression/synthetic_planet.dat
in flux 0.2 0.2 1 -3 -3 1 log10 part 0 24
ncpus 1
